{"id":"wb-6-1047","name":"黎平会议会址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"黎平会议会址","text":"黎平会议会址位于中国贵州省黎平县县城德凤镇二郎坡，是1934年中央红军长征途径黎平时召开黎平会议的会址，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位，毛泽东旧居、红军教导师及红军干部修养连驻地一同列入保护。\n黎平会议会址位于二郎坡52号，时为红军总司令部驻地，原为胡荣顺店铺，建于清嘉庆年间，占地800平方米，建筑面积634平方米，砖木结构平房，共三进九天井。\n毛泽东旧居位于二郎坡3号，原为朱家住宅，为二进二层五间木结构楼房，占地832平方米，建筑面积572平方米。\n红军教导师及红军干部修养连驻地原为廖家住宅及店铺，建于清末，共有三进，为前店后宅式建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%8E%E5%B9%B3%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E4%BC%9A%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86718062,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86718062","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/523e5cbae68e890b48e974a3.jpg","title":"黎平县老街（黎平会议所在地） - panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%BB%8E%E5%B9%B3%E5%8E%BF%E8%80%81%E8%A1%97%EF%BC%88%E9%BB%8E%E5%B9%B3%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/%E9%BB%8E%E5%B9%B3%E5%8E%BF%E8%80%81%E8%A1%97%EF%BC%88%E9%BB%8E%E5%B9%B3%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Joseph Yu","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"黎平县老街（黎平会议所在地）","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Site of Liping Meeting","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Site_of_Liping_Meeting"}}